- op: discuss  # dce0
  at: '2026-05-01T09:04:37Z'  # dce0
  by: agent  # dce0
  actor: jgstern_agent  # dce0
  clock: 3  # dce0
  nonce: dce0  # dce0
  message: "Done in PR #3491. Re-running the sweep against current production code (post-Phase-3) reduced the original 45 unregistered values to 30 — many of the originals (annotated_dispatches, crdt_publishes, message_dispatch, di_registers, delegates_to, registers_routes, enqueues, emits, event_subscribes, etc.) were registered as endpoint_shape during ADR-0025 / ADR-0026 / Phase 3 PRs, then folded by Phase-3 producer migration.\n\nTRIAGE OUTCOME for the remaining 30:\n\nNOISE (5, documented but not registered): cfg.py uses an Edge.create-shaped _FringeEdge dataclass with an edge_type= kwarg whose values are control-flow-graph labels (always, case, exception, false, true). These are not Edge.edge_type values — the sweep regex matches the kwarg name coincidentally.\n\nMISSING RELATIONSHIP-AXIS CANONICALS (7, added): inherits, decorated_by, includes, defines_target, data_flows_to, module_exports, overrides. Five of these appear in ADR-0023's 'Edge types that stay' list; producers were already emitting them; the registry was just incomplete. module_exports and overrides are obvious-canonical additions the original list didn't enumerate.\n\nENDPOINT_SHAPE CANDIDATES (18, added with fold-target descriptions): abi_call, association, build_tag_alternative_of, caller_invokes, contains_routes, crypto_flow, depends, extends_template, includes_class, includes_template, invokes_callback, links_to, notifies_resource, renders, requires_resource, signal_receiver, template_calls, uses_mixin, uses_vocabulary. Each carries a plausible canonical fold target in its description. Phase-3-style migration deferred until per-language / per-pattern audit picks the meta-key shape; this PR closes the registry gap so the drift linter has full coverage.\n\nRegistry counts after the sweep: 86 total (24 relationship, 58 endpoint_shape, 4 pending_classification). SCHEMA_VERSION 0.3.0 → 0.3.1 (additive minor: 25 new enum values). Going forward, future analyzer additions must register new edge_type values at emit-site time or the drift linter blocks the commit."  # dce0
