  message: "Discoverability back-pointer (2026-07-20). This triage re-added 19 endpoint_shape registry-completeness values and deferred their fold \"to a future per-language/per-pattern audit\" that was never filed until now. That deferred fold tail (25 endpoint_shape + 4 pending_classification still in the live registry, even though WI-vomoj-suhaz \"Phase 4: remove endpoint_shape values\" is done) is now owned by WI-kivip-gijok-pugag-balid-rizin-lutuk-botul-zizon + sub-items WI-hirud / WI-pumav / WI-sumik. No action needed on this item — it closed correctly for its own scope; this note just resolves the \"why is the axis non-empty if Phase 4 is done?\" confusion for future readers."  # 0172
